# RandomEvents in co-op, regional ambushes: rolled by the host only, for every player's region, the same creatures on
# both screens.
# - The client's own regional start is refused (the authority gate).
# - The host's: a monster pool forced around the host standing in the Forest - their spawns used to be plain
#   instantiates nobody announced.
# - The client alone in regions the host is not in: the host rolls each region's ambush around the client's body
#   (RegionShare -> the API's region coordinator). Three regions are walked (each pool skips 1 in 4).
# Bandit regional pools (the Ruins, the mine) are in boss areas and caves, which RandomEvents blocks by default (its
# options); bandits are covered by randomevents_bandits.coop.
#
# Needs RandomEvents from feature/coop-update, and hero 0 slot 65 (fixture_redtower_rl.coop): a level the pools serve.
# Spots found by probing: Forest -2000,-4000; Auwald 2000,0; Leuchtwald -6000,-4000; Heide -2132,-5262; the Ruins
# 20,1170 (a boss area - blocked).

default hero 0
default slotA 65
default slotB 65
include session.coop
A tp -2000,-4000
B tp -1960,-4000
sleep 15
A worldevent
B worldevent
A expect counter regionstaken >= 1 timeout=20

# The client cannot roll one.
B expect worldevent region Forest contains "none started" timeout=5

# Monsters around the host, in the Forest.
capture base A counter spawnsannounced
A expect worldevent region Forest,Auwald,Leuchtwald,Heide,River !contains "none started" timeout=5
sleep 20
A expect counter spawnsannounced != $base timeout=20
capture monsters A counter spawnsannounced
B expect counter spawnsbuilt == $monsters timeout=20
A actors 700
B actors 700

# The client alone: the host waits in the Ruins (blocked for its own ambushes), the client walks three regions.
A tp 20,1170
sleep 5
capture before A counter spawnsannounced
B tp 2000,0
sleep 3
B worldevent
sleep 15
B tp -6000,-4000
sleep 3
B worldevent
sleep 15
B tp -2132,-5262
sleep 3
B worldevent
sleep 15
A expect counter spawnsannounced != $before timeout=20
capture all A counter spawnsannounced
B expect counter spawnsbuilt == $all timeout=20
B actors 700
A worldevent
